# LaTeX intermediates. The .tex, the generated numbers.tex/references.bib, the figure
# panels and the built PDF ARE tracked: the PDF is the deliverable, and tests/
# test_manuscript.py asserts it is newer than everything it is built from, so a stale
# PDF cannot ship alongside an edited source.
manuscript/*.aux
manuscript/*.log
manuscript/*.out
manuscript/*.bbl
manuscript/*.blg
manuscript/figures/_light_*
